### 查询 2024 财务交易
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/transactions/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","postedAfter":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z","postedBefore":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","marketplaceId":"ATVPDKIKX0DER"}

### 查询账户余额
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/balances/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","marketplaceIds":["ATVPDKIKX0DER"],"balanceType":"TOTAL"}

### 查询财务汇总
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/summary/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","marketplaceIds":["ATVPDKIKX0DER"],"periodStart":"2026-08-01","periodEnd":"2026-08-07"}

### 查询财务事件组
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/financial-event-groups/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","financialEventGroupStartedAfter":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z","financialEventGroupStartedBefore":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z"}

### 按事件组查询财务事件
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/financial-events/by-group
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","eventGroupId":"1234567890","postedAfter":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z"}

### 按订单查询财务事件
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/financial-events/by-order
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","orderId":"123-1234567-1234567"}

### 查询财务事件
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/financial-events/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","postedAfter":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z"}

### 发起按需付款
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/payouts/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"DE","payoutBody":{"marketplaceId":"A1PA6795UKMFR9","accountType":"Standard Orders"}}

### 查询付款记录
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/payouts/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","marketplaceIds":["ATVPDKIKX0DER"],"createdAfter":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z"}

### 查询付款方式
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/payment-methods/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","marketplaceId":"ATVPDKIKX0DER","paymentMethodTypes":["BANK_ACCOUNT"]}

### 查询预计付款
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/payouts/expected
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","marketplaceIds":["ATVPDKIKX0DER"]}

### 查询发票头
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/invoices/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","marketplaceId":"ATVPDKIKX0DER","fromIssueDate":"2026-08-01","toIssueDate":"2026-08-07"}

### 查询发票详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/finances/invoices/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","marketplaceId":"ATVPDKIKX0DER","invoiceIdentifier":"INV-202505001~ABCDEF"}
